# The build context was previously unfiltered, which meant `COPY . .` pulled
# .env.local into an image layer. Anyone who pulled the image could read the
# Resend and Groq keys out of it. Everything secret is excluded here and
# injected at runtime from a Kubernetes Secret instead.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Rebuilt inside the image. Copying the host's arm64 native addons into an
# amd64 build produces a binary that dies with "invalid ELF header" at boot.
node_modules
.next
out

.git
.gitignore
.github

# Local database and uploads. These live on the PersistentVolumeClaim.
.data
data
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite

.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Docs and tooling that add nothing to a running container.
k8s-deployment
.agents
.claude
*.md
!README.md
